    <briefdescription>
<para>An interface representing the launcher tool&apos;s interaction with output streams. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="dd/dbc/interfaceorg_1_1xvm_1_1tool_1_1_console" kindref="compound">Console</ref> provides simple output methods for displaying messages. It does NOT track severity state or perform filtering - that is the responsibility of the <computeroutput><ref refid="d4/dfd/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1tool_1_1_launcher" kindref="compound">Launcher</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
